  <main_text>
    <l n="1">sem intra cancellos Consiliariorum primas</l>
    <l n="2">tenebat, &amp; Doctor Caspar Hedio, summi</l>
    <l n="3">templi Moguntini pastor, qui, simul ac Ar-</l>
    <l n="4">gentinam anno vicesimo tertio venerunt,</l>
    <l n="5">firmiora coeperant fundamenta poni Evangelicæ Ecclesiæ.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">AUGUSTÆ Vindelicorum Joannes Fros-</l>
    <l n="7">chius, Theologiæ Doctor, Carmelita, inter</l>
    <l n="8">primos fuit, qui Evangelium sincere prædi-</l>
    <l n="9">carent.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">NORIMBERGA Andreas Osiander pri-</l>
    <l n="11">mam concionem puriorem habet die</l>
    <l n="12">Dominico 23. Februarii de semine.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Ibidem GALLUS KORN, Monachus</l>
    <l n="14">Franciscanus, cum gustum religionis verae</l>
    <l n="15">haberet, nec id dissimularet in concionibus,</l>
    <l n="16">in odium Fratrum venit. Aperienti autem</l>
    <l n="17">forte Cyprianum occurrit dictum Apostoli</l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Denuntiamus vobis, fratres, in nomine Iesu Christi,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>ut vos subtrahatis ab omni fratre ambulante</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>inordinatè.</i> 2 Thess. 3, 6. Perculsus hoc effato,</l>
    <l n="21">cum sensum illius ex Ambrosio didicisset,</l>
    <l n="22">Monasterium deseruit 12. Junii.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">FRANCOFURTI ad Moenum, Domi-</l>
    <l n="24">nica Invocavit Hartmannus Ibachius, exul</l>
    <l n="25">Christi, in Coenobio S. Catharinæ, Amâdo</l>
    <l n="26">ab Holtzhausen, &amp; Joanne Froschen, Pa-</l>
    <l n="27">triciis, Scabinis &amp; Senatoribus, dictiq;</l>
    <l n="28">Coenobii patronis (connivente Senatu) curan-</l>
    <l n="29">tibus, Evangelium pure docere coepit.</l>
  </main_text>
